# Lunduke Linux Kernel config delta: 7.2.6-lcos15 → 7.2.6-lcos16
# Built 2026-10-07 — config and packaging only; no kernel debs, no ISO bake.
#
# Base is the merged lcos15 config (PR #6, 2192009). lcos12, lcos13, lcos14,
# and lcos15 files are not edited. This file is the full lcos15 → lcos16 delta.
# olddefconfig: Linux 7.2.6, gcc-14 (Ubuntu 14.2.0-4ubuntu2~24.04.1),
# LOCALVERSION= (same finalize as the build script). A second olddefconfig
# on the saved config kept every requested symbol. The only line it dropped
# was "# CONFIG_RUST is not set", which scripts/config --disable RUST
# appends again. Toolchain probe lines are unchanged from lcos15.
#
# lcos16 enables the LCOS 0.9 hardware gap pick-list (items 1–53) on lcos15.
# Drivers are =m except where 7.2.6 Kconfig offers only a bool (=y):
#   PINCTRL_AMD, DRM_ACCEL, DRM_AMD_ACP, DRM_AMD_ISP, NVME_HWMON,
#   RMI4_F03, RMI4_F12, RMI4_F30.
# Checklist: docs/lcos16-module-verify.txt.
#
# Already on in lcos15, still on:
#   USB_NET_AX88179_178A, USB_NET_AX8817X, USB_NET_CDC_NCM,
#   TUN, KVM, KVM_INTEL, KVM_AMD.
#
# Absent in Linux 7.2.6 (not invented):
#   SND_AMD_ASOC_ACP7X — no symbol. SND_SOC_SOF_AMD_ACP70 covers ACP7.0
#   and ACP7.1 in one option. SND_AMD_ASOC_ACP70 is ACP7.0 only.
#   VBOXSF — no symbol. Shared folders are CONFIG_VBOXSF_FS=m.
# Item 43 (proprietary NVIDIA) is not a CONFIG. Nouveau stays =m.
# No out-of-tree nvidia module is added.
#
# Parents olddefconfig cannot invent, set so the requested symbols stick:
#   NFC_NCI=m (NFC_NXP_NCI depends on it; default n).
#   VIRT_DRIVERS=y (VBOXGUEST is inside that menu). That menu's VMGENID
#   defaults to y, so olddefconfig sets CONFIG_VMGENID=y.
# TYPEC_TCPM was already m in lcos15.
#
# Other olddefconfig fills are listed in docs/lcos16-module-verify.txt.
# Notable ones: NET_DEVLINK=y (IOSM; hidden bool), WWAN_DEBUGFS=y
# (default, prompt hidden unless EXPERT), PM_GENERIC_DOMAINS=y (ACP/ISP),
# VFIO_GROUP/CONTAINER/IOMMU_TYPE1, VHOST + VHOST_IOTLB, WATCHDOG_CORE,
# the HDA scodec and AMD ACP helper modules, and the MT76/rtw USB libraries.
#
# Left off because they were not named:
#   LIBERTAS_USB/SDIO/SPI, WLCORE_SDIO, NFC_NXP_NCI_I2C, VFIO_PCI,
#   SOUNDWIRE_AMD (so SND_SOC_SOF_AMD_SOUNDWIRE stays invisible),
#   WWAN_HWSIM, VFIO_NOIOMMU, RMI4_I2C, KVM_XEN.
# USB_SERIAL is m, so USB_SERIAL_CONSOLE (depends on USB_SERIAL=y) stays hidden.
#
# CRITICAL: # CONFIG_RUST is not set (No Forced Rust).
# CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-lunduke".
#
# Unified diff of full .config follows.
#
